.com","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","words":[{"text":"PR 已经开了："},{"text":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","link":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","to":{"peek":"pull"}},{"text":" ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791256200000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"6 小时前","full":"10/6 03:10:00"}}},{"seq":252,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000252","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"在看了","md":[["p",[[0,3]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791256620000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"6 小时前","full":"10/6 03:17:00"}}},{"seq":253,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000253","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","words":[{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."}],"attachments":[{"name":"screenshot-253.png","path":".stillfail/uploads/253-screenshot.png","size":248366,"width":1170,"height":2532,"thumbhash":"3OcRJYB4d3h/iIeHeEh3eIhw+j3A","owner":"k-maple-0"}],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791257040000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"6 小时前","full":"10/6 03:24:00"}}},{"seq":254,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000254","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0b","text":"迁移演练的完整记录：\n\n1. `pg_dump --format=directory -j 8` 导出 412 GB，用时 38 分钟；\n2. 新实例 Postgres 17，`pg_restore -j 16`，用时 1 小时 12 分钟；\n3. 逻辑复制追平增量，延迟稳定在 200 ms 以内；\n4. 切换：停写 → 等复制追平 → 改连接串 → 恢复写，**停写 3 分 41 秒**；\n5. 校验：每张表行数一致，抽样 10 万行逐列比对无差异。\n\n发现的问题：\n\n- `orders` 上有一个函数索引用了 `to_char`，17 里被标成了不安全，需要改成 immutable 的包装函数；\n- 连接池 pgbouncer 1.21 和 17 的 SCRAM 有兼容问题，升到 1.23 解决。\n\n正式迁移建议放在周六上午，预计停写 4 分钟以内。需要你确认时间，我来发公告。","md":[["p",[[0,10]]],["list",[["li",[["code",{"content":[16,47]}],[48,68]]],["li",[[72,88],["code",{"content":[89,105]}],[106,121]]],["li",[[125,150]]],["li",[[154,181],["b",[[183,194]]],[196,197]]],["li",[[201,228]]]],{"ordered":true}],["p",[[230,236]]],["list",[["li",[["code",{"content":[241,247]}],[248,260],["code",{"content":[261,268]}],[269,303]]],["li",[[306,355]]]]],["p",[[357,396]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791257460000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"GPT-6 Astra · high","agent":"k-maple-0b","maker":{"id":"openai"},"runtime":"codex"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 03:31:00"}}},{"seq":255,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000255","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"👍","words":[{"text":"👍"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791257880000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 03:38:00"}}},{"seq":256,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000256","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.","md":[["p",[[0,131]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791258300000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 03:45:00"}}},{"seq":257,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000257","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","words":[{"text":"PR 已经开了："},{"text":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","link":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","to":{"peek":"pull"}},{"text":" ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791258720000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 03:52:00"}}},{"seq":258,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000258","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"合吧","md":[["p",[[0,2]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791259140000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 03:59:00"}}},{"seq":259,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000259","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"Here's what I found in the station worker's memory growth:\n\n- RSS grows ~38 MB/hour with 6 chats open, and never comes back down;\n- heap snapshots at 0 h, 2 h and 6 h show `MdCache` holding 41k entries at the end, 93% of them for archived chats;\n- nothing evicts them: `forget()` is only called when a chat is deleted, never when it is archived.\n\nThe fix (PR #5251):\n\n```ts\nconst cache = new Lru<string, Md>(500, (key) => kept.delete(key));\ndata.onArchived((station, key) => cache.dropWhere((k) => k.startsWith(`${station}\\u0001${key}`)));\n```\n\nAfter it, RSS is flat at 212 MB over 6 hours with the same load. I also added a test that archives 1,000 chats and checks the cache stays at 500.\n\nOne question: should the cap be per workspace or for the whole device? Per device is simpler, but a big workspace could push a small one's chats out.","words":[{"text":"Here's what I found in the station worker's memory growth:\n\n- RSS grows ~38 MB/hour with 6 chats open, and never comes back down;\n- heap snapshots at 0 h, 2 h and 6 h show `MdCache` holding 41k entries at the end, 93% of them for archived chats;\n- nothing evicts them: `forget()` is only called when a chat is deleted, never when it is archived.\n\nThe fix (PR #5251):\n\n```ts\nconst cache = new Lru<string, Md>(500, (key) => kept.delete(key));\ndata.onArchived((station, key) => cache.dropWhere((k) => k.startsWith(`${station}\\u0001${key}`)));\n```\n\nAfter it, RSS is flat at 212 MB over 6 hours with the same load. I also added a test that archives 1,000 chats and checks the cache stays at 500.\n\nOne question: should the cap be per workspace or for the whole device? Per device is simpler, but a big workspace could push a small one's chats out."}],"attachments":[{"name":"report-259.pdf","path":".stillfail/uploads/259-report.pdf","size":1204590,"owner":"k-maple-0"}],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791259560000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 04:06:00"}}},{"seq":260,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000260","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。\n\n和[上次的讨论](https://still.fail/o/ws/maple/k-maple-12)是同一个问题。","md":[["p",[[0,79]]],["p",[[81,82],["a",[[83,88]],{"href":"https://still.fail/o/ws/maple/k-maple-12","to":{"chat":true}}],[131,138]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791259980000,"mine":false,"system":false,"chats":[{"href":"https://still.fail/o/ws/maple/k-maple-12","title":"整理新人 onboarding 文档","thread":2012}],"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 04:13:00"}},"options":[{"label":"改到周日上午"},{"label":"先不做"},{"label":"可以，周六 9 点","detail":"按计划停写 4 分钟","recommended":true}],"card":{"assignee":"me@x.com","assigneeText":"待你决策","type":"options","options":[{"label":"改到周日上午"},{"label":"先不做"},{"label":"可以，周六 9 点","detail":"按计划停写 4 分钟","recommended":true}]},"decision":{"resolved":true,"text":"Lina Park 回复了"}},{"seq":261,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000261","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"收到","words":[{"text":"收到"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791260400000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 04:20:00"}}},{"seq":262,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000262","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.","md":[["p",[[0,131]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791260820000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"5 小时前","full":"10/6 04:27:00"}}},{"seq":263,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000263","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","words":[{"text":"PR 已经开了："},{"text":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","link":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","to":{"peek":"pull"}},{"text":" ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791261240000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 04:34:00"}}},{"seq":264,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000264","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0b","text":"## 结论\n\n列表掉帧的根因是**每一帧都在重新测量行高**：`measure_row` 在滚动时被调用了 1,800 次/秒。\n\n### 做了什么\n\n1. 行高在第一次布局时算好并缓存，键是行的 id 和宽度；\n2. 宽度变化（旋转、分屏）时整表失效一次，而不是逐行；\n3. 头像图片解码挪到后台线程，主线程只拿结果。\n\n```kotlin\nval height = heights.getOrPut(row.id to width) { measure(row, width) }\n```\n\n### 结果\n\n| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |\n\n录屏和 trace 在附件里。还有一个问题需要你决定：低端机上要不要把头像的圆角改成预先裁好的位图？能再省 1.5 ms/帧，但内存多 4 MB。","md":[["h",[[3,5]],{"depth":2}],["p",[[7,15],["b",[[17,28]]],[30,31],["code",{"content":[32,43]}],[44,64]]],["h",[[70,74]],{"depth":3}],["list",[["li",[[79,106]]],["li",[[110,135]]],["li",[[139,160]]]],{"ordered":true}],["pre",{"code":[172,242],"lang":"kotlin","ink":"g4a7c2a8i8a20i7"}],["h",[[252,254]],{"depth":3}],["table",[["tr",[["th",[[258,260]]],["th",[[263,267]]],["th",[[270,272]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[297,304]]],["td",[[307,312]]],["td",[[315,319]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[324,334]]],["td",[[337,342]]],["td",[[345,349]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[354,367]]],["td",[[370,375]]],["td",[[378,382]]]]]],{"align":[null,null,null],"md":"| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |","csv":"设备,之前掉帧,之后\nPixel 8,23.1%,0.6%\nGalaxy S24,17.4%,0.9%\nRedmi Note 13,41.0%,3.2%"}],["p",[[386,459]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791261660000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"GPT-6 Astra · high","agent":"k-maple-0b","maker":{"id":"openai"},"runtime":"codex"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 04:41:00"}}},{"seq":265,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000265","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","words":[{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[{"author":"k-maple-0b","text":"## 结论\n\n列表掉帧的根因是**每一帧都在重新测量行高**：`measure_row` 在滚动时被调用了 1,800 次/秒。\n\n### 做了什么\n\n1. 行高在第一次布局时算好并缓存，键是行的 id 和宽度；\n2. 宽度变化（旋转、分屏","comment":"","ts":"1001.000264","role":"agent"}],"createdAt":1791262080000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 04:48:00"}}},{"seq":266,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000266","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。\n\nTests pass locally and on CI. The flake was a race between the window becoming key and the first click; waiting for the named event fixed it in 200 runs.","md":[["p",[[0,79]]],["p",[[81,234]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791262500000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 04:55:00"}}},{"seq":267,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000267","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"这个先不改","words":[{"text":"这个先不改"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791262920000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 05:02:00"}}},{"seq":268,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000268","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.","md":[["p",[[0,131]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791263340000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 05:09:00"}}},{"seq":269,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000269","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"迁移演练的完整记录：\n\n1. `pg_dump --format=directory -j 8` 导出 412 GB，用时 38 分钟；\n2. 新实例 Postgres 17，`pg_restore -j 16`，用时 1 小时 12 分钟；\n3. 逻辑复制追平增量，延迟稳定在 200 ms 以内；\n4. 切换：停写 → 等复制追平 → 改连接串 → 恢复写，**停写 3 分 41 秒**；\n5. 校验：每张表行数一致，抽样 10 万行逐列比对无差异。\n\n发现的问题：\n\n- `orders` 上有一个函数索引用了 `to_char`，17 里被标成了不安全，需要改成 immutable 的包装函数；\n- 连接池 pgbouncer 1.21 和 17 的 SCRAM 有兼容问题，升到 1.23 解决。\n\n正式迁移建议放在周六上午，预计停写 4 分钟以内。需要你确认时间，我来发公告。","words":[{"text":"迁移演练的完整记录：\n\n1. `pg_dump --format=directory -j 8` 导出 412 GB，用时 38 分钟；\n2. 新实例 Postgres 17，`pg_restore -j 16`，用时 1 小时 12 分钟；\n3. 逻辑复制追平增量，延迟稳定在 200 ms 以内；\n4. 切换：停写 → 等复制追平 → 改连接串 → 恢复写，**停写 3 分 41 秒**；\n5. 校验：每张表行数一致，抽样 10 万行逐列比对无差异。\n\n发现的问题：\n\n- `orders` 上有一个函数索引用了 `to_char`，17 里被标成了不安全，需要改成 immutable 的包装函数；\n- 连接池 pgbouncer 1.21 和 17 的 SCRAM 有兼容问题，升到 1.23 解决。\n\n正式迁移建议放在周六上午，预计停写 4 分钟以内。需要你确认时间，我来发公告。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791263760000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 05:16:00"}}},{"seq":270,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000270","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"好的","md":[["p",[[0,2]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791264180000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 05:23:00"}}},{"seq":271,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000271","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","words":[{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791264600000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"4 小时前","full":"10/6 05:30:00"}}},{"seq":272,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000272","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。","md":[["p",[[0,79]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791265020000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"3 小时前","full":"10/6 05:37:00"}}},{"seq":273,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000273","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"可以，按这个来","words":[{"text":"可以，按这个来"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791265440000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"3 小时前","full":"10/6 05:44:00"}}},{"seq":274,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000274","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0b","text":"Here's what I found in the station worker's memory growth:\n\n- RSS grows ~38 MB/hour with 6 chats open, and never comes back down;\n- heap snapshots at 0 h, 2 h and 6 h show `MdCache` holding 41k entries at the end, 93% of them for archived chats;\n- nothing evicts them: `forget()` is only called when a chat is deleted, never when it is archived.\n\nThe fix (PR #5251):\n\n```ts\nconst cache = new Lru<string, Md>(500, (key) => kept.delete(key));\ndata.onArchived((station, key) => cache.dropWhere((k) => k.startsWith(`${station}\\u0001${key}`)));\n```\n\nAfter it, RSS is flat at 212 MB over 6 hours with the same load. I also added a test that archives 1,000 chats and checks the cache stays at 500.\n\nOne question: should the cap be per workspace or for the whole device? Per device is simpler, but a big workspace could push a small one's chats out.","md":[["p",[[0,58]]],["list",[["li",[[62,129]]],["li",[[132,172],["code",{"content":[173,180]}],[181,245]]],["li",[[248,269],["code",{"content":[270,278]}],[279,345]]]]],["p",[[347,366]]],["pre",{"code":[374,539],"lang":"ts","ink":"h6j6c2h4i3cl6c2j2c2f3c3j3c5j4ch6cj3c4j4ci10c2j7c2j3c5j5ci9c2jc5jci10ced22ec4"}],["p",[[545,690]]],["p",[[692,841]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791265860000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"GPT-6 Astra · high","agent":"k-maple-0b","maker":{"id":"openai"},"runtime":"codex"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"3 小时前","full":"10/6 05:51:00"}}},{"seq":275,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000275","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","words":[{"text":"PR 已经开了："},{"text":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","link":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","to":{"peek":"pull"}},{"text":" ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791266280000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"3 小时前","full":"10/6 05:58:00"}}},{"seq":276,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000276","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"谢谢！\n\n![](screenshot-276.png)","md":[["p",[[0,3]]],["p",[["img",{"src":"screenshot-276.png"}]]]],"attachments":[{"name":"screenshot-276.png","path":".stillfail/uploads/276-screenshot.png","size":248389,"width":1170,"height":2532,"thumbhash":"3OcRJYB4d3h/iIeHeEh3eIhw+j3A","owner":"k-maple-0"}],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791266700000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"3 小时前","full":"10/6 06:05:00"}},"placed":["screenshot-276.png"]},{"seq":277,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000277","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","words":[{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791267120000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"3 小时前","full":"10/6 06:12:00"}}},{"seq":278,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000278","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。","md":[["p",[[0,79]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791267540000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"3 小时前","full":"10/6 06:19:00"}}},{"seq":279,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000279","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"## 结论\n\n列表掉帧的根因是**每一帧都在重新测量行高**：`measure_row` 在滚动时被调用了 1,800 次/秒。\n\n### 做了什么\n\n1. 行高在第一次布局时算好并缓存，键是行的 id 和宽度；\n2. 宽度变化（旋转、分屏）时整表失效一次，而不是逐行；\n3. 头像图片解码挪到后台线程，主线程只拿结果。\n\n```kotlin\nval height = heights.getOrPut(row.id to width) { measure(row, width) }\n```\n\n### 结果\n\n| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |\n\n录屏和 trace 在附件里。还有一个问题需要你决定：低端机上要不要把头像的圆角改成预先裁好的位图？能再省 1.5 ms/帧，但内存多 4 MB。","words":[{"text":"## 结论\n\n列表掉帧的根因是**每一帧都在重新测量行高**：`measure_row` 在滚动时被调用了 1,800 次/秒。\n\n### 做了什么\n\n1. 行高在第一次布局时算好并缓存，键是行的 id 和宽度；\n2. 宽度变化（旋转、分屏）时整表失效一次，而不是逐行；\n3. 头像图片解码挪到后台线程，主线程只拿结果。\n\n```kotlin\nval height = heights.getOrPut(row.id to width) { measure(row, width) }\n```\n\n### 结果\n\n| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |\n\n录屏和 trace 在附件里。还有一个问题需要你决定：低端机上要不要把头像的圆角改成预先裁好的位图？能再省 1.5 ms/帧，但内存多 4 MB。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791267960000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"3 小时前","full":"10/6 06:26:00"}}},{"seq":280,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000280","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.\n\n慢查询的原因是 orders(created_at) 上没有和 tenant_id 组合的索引，全表扫了 1200 万行。加了组合索引后从 2.3s 降到 18ms，迁移脚本在 PR 里。","md":[["p",[[0,131]]],["p",[[133,227]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791268380000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 06:33:00"}}},{"seq":281,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000281","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","words":[{"text":"PR 已经开了："},{"text":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","link":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","to":{"peek":"pull"}},{"text":" ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791268800000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 06:40:00"}}},{"seq":282,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000282","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"在看了","md":[["p",[[0,3]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791269220000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 06:47:00"}}},{"seq":283,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000283","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","words":[{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791269640000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 06:54:00"}}},{"seq":284,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000284","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0b","text":"迁移演练的完整记录：\n\n1. `pg_dump --format=directory -j 8` 导出 412 GB，用时 38 分钟；\n2. 新实例 Postgres 17，`pg_restore -j 16`，用时 1 小时 12 分钟；\n3. 逻辑复制追平增量，延迟稳定在 200 ms 以内；\n4. 切换：停写 → 等复制追平 → 改连接串 → 恢复写，**停写 3 分 41 秒**；\n5. 校验：每张表行数一致，抽样 10 万行逐列比对无差异。\n\n发现的问题：\n\n- `orders` 上有一个函数索引用了 `to_char`，17 里被标成了不安全，需要改成 immutable 的包装函数；\n- 连接池 pgbouncer 1.21 和 17 的 SCRAM 有兼容问题，升到 1.23 解决。\n\n正式迁移建议放在周六上午，预计停写 4 分钟以内。需要你确认时间，我来发公告。","md":[["p",[[0,10]]],["list",[["li",[["code",{"content":[16,47]}],[48,68]]],["li",[[72,88],["code",{"content":[89,105]}],[106,121]]],["li",[[125,150]]],["li",[[154,181],["b",[[183,194]]],[196,197]]],["li",[[201,228]]]],{"ordered":true}],["p",[[230,236]]],["list",[["li",[["code",{"content":[241,247]}],[248,260],["code",{"content":[261,268]}],[269,303]]],["li",[[306,355]]]]],["p",[[357,396]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791270060000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"GPT-6 Astra · high","agent":"k-maple-0b","maker":{"id":"openai"},"runtime":"codex"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 07:01:00"}}},{"seq":285,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000285","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"👍","words":[{"text":"👍"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791270480000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 07:08:00"}}},{"seq":286,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000286","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.","md":[["p",[[0,131]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791270900000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 07:15:00"}}},{"seq":287,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000287","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。\n\n需要人工确认：生产库迁移要停写大约 4 分钟，什么时候可以做？我建议周六上午 9 点。","words":[{"text":"PR 已经开了："},{"text":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","link":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","to":{"peek":"pull"}},{"text":" ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。\n\n需要人工确认：生产库迁移要停写大约 4 分钟，什么时候可以做？我建议周六上午 9 点。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[{"author":"k-maple-0","text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready wh","comment":"","ts":"1001.000286","role":"agent"}],"createdAt":1791271320000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 07:22:00"}}},{"seq":288,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000288","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"合吧","md":[["p",[[0,2]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791271740000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 07:29:00"}},"elsewhere":[{"key":"k-maple-0/1/0","after":288,"createdAt":1791271800000,"text":"CI 绿了，PR #5244 可以合了。","place":{"name":"#C05ENG0001","surface":"slack"},"failed":false,"attachments":[],"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"2 小时前","full":"10/6 07:30:00"}}}]},{"seq":289,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000289","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"Here's what I found in the station worker's memory growth:\n\n- RSS grows ~38 MB/hour with 6 chats open, and never comes back down;\n- heap snapshots at 0 h, 2 h and 6 h show `MdCache` holding 41k entries at the end, 93% of them for archived chats;\n- nothing evicts them: `forget()` is only called when a chat is deleted, never when it is archived.\n\nThe fix (PR #5251):\n\n```ts\nconst cache = new Lru<string, Md>(500, (key) => kept.delete(key));\ndata.onArchived((station, key) => cache.dropWhere((k) => k.startsWith(`${station}\\u0001${key}`)));\n```\n\nAfter it, RSS is flat at 212 MB over 6 hours with the same load. I also added a test that archives 1,000 chats and checks the cache stays at 500.\n\nOne question: should the cap be per workspace or for the whole device? Per device is simpler, but a big workspace could push a small one's chats out.","words":[{"text":"Here's what I found in the station worker's memory growth:\n\n- RSS grows ~38 MB/hour with 6 chats open, and never comes back down;\n- heap snapshots at 0 h, 2 h and 6 h show `MdCache` holding 41k entries at the end, 93% of them for archived chats;\n- nothing evicts them: `forget()` is only called when a chat is deleted, never when it is archived.\n\nThe fix (PR #5251):\n\n```ts\nconst cache = new Lru<string, Md>(500, (key) => kept.delete(key));\ndata.onArchived((station, key) => cache.dropWhere((k) => k.startsWith(`${station}\\u0001${key}`)));\n```\n\nAfter it, RSS is flat at 212 MB over 6 hours with the same load. I also added a test that archives 1,000 chats and checks the cache stays at 500.\n\nOne question: should the cap be per workspace or for the whole device? Per device is simpler, but a big workspace could push a small one's chats out."}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791272160000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"1 小时前","full":"10/6 07:36:00"}}},{"seq":290,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000290","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。","md":[["p",[[0,79]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791272580000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"1 小时前","full":"10/6 07:43:00"}}},{"seq":291,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000291","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"收到","words":[{"text":"收到"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791273000000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"1 小时前","full":"10/6 07:50:00"}}},{"seq":292,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000292","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.","md":[["p",[[0,131]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791273420000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"1 小时前","full":"10/6 07:57:00"}}},{"seq":293,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000293","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。","words":[{"text":"PR 已经开了："},{"text":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","link":"https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244","to":{"peek":"pull"}},{"text":" ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791273840000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"56 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:04:00"}},"elsewhere":[{"key":"k-maple-0/3/0","after":293,"createdAt":1791274200000,"text":"已经合进 main，beta 今晚出。Pixel 8 上的掉帧录屏在 PR 里。","place":{"name":"#C05ENG0001","surface":"slack"},"failed":false,"attachments":[],"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"50 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:10:00"}}}]},{"seq":294,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000294","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0b","text":"## 结论\n\n列表掉帧的根因是**每一帧都在重新测量行高**：`measure_row` 在滚动时被调用了 1,800 次/秒。\n\n### 做了什么\n\n1. 行高在第一次布局时算好并缓存，键是行的 id 和宽度；\n2. 宽度变化（旋转、分屏）时整表失效一次，而不是逐行；\n3. 头像图片解码挪到后台线程，主线程只拿结果。\n\n```kotlin\nval height = heights.getOrPut(row.id to width) { measure(row, width) }\n```\n\n### 结果\n\n| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |\n\n录屏和 trace 在附件里。还有一个问题需要你决定：低端机上要不要把头像的圆角改成预先裁好的位图？能再省 1.5 ms/帧，但内存多 4 MB。","md":[["h",[[3,5]],{"depth":2}],["p",[[7,15],["b",[[17,28]]],[30,31],["code",{"content":[32,43]}],[44,64]]],["h",[[70,74]],{"depth":3}],["list",[["li",[[79,106]]],["li",[[110,135]]],["li",[[139,160]]]],{"ordered":true}],["pre",{"code":[172,242],"lang":"kotlin","ink":"g4a7c2a8i8a20i7"}],["h",[[252,254]],{"depth":3}],["table",[["tr",[["th",[[258,260]]],["th",[[263,267]]],["th",[[270,272]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[297,304]]],["td",[[307,312]]],["td",[[315,319]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[324,334]]],["td",[[337,342]]],["td",[[345,349]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[354,367]]],["td",[[370,375]]],["td",[[378,382]]]]]],{"align":[null,null,null],"md":"| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |","csv":"设备,之前掉帧,之后\nPixel 8,23.1%,0.6%\nGalaxy S24,17.4%,0.9%\nRedmi Note 13,41.0%,3.2%"}],["p",[[386,459]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791274260000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"GPT-6 Astra · high","agent":"k-maple-0b","maker":{"id":"openai"},"runtime":"codex"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"49 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:11:00"}}},{"seq":295,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000295","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012.","words":[{"text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791274680000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"42 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:18:00"}}},{"seq":296,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000296","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。","md":[["p",[[0,79]]]],"attachments":[{"name":"trace-296.json","path":".stillfail/uploads/296-trace.json","size":1204627,"owner":"k-maple-0"}],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791275100000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"35 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:25:00"}}},{"seq":297,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000297","authorKind":"person","author":"lina@acme.dev","text":"这个先不改","words":[{"text":"这个先不改"}],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791275520000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Lina Park"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"28 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:32:00"}}},{"seq":298,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000298","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"Done: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.","md":[["p",[[0,131]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791275940000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"21 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:39:00"}}},{"seq":299,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000299","authorKind":"person","author":"me@x.com","text":"迁移演练的完整记录：\n\n1. `pg_dump --format=directory -j 8` 导出 412 GB，用时 38 分钟；\n2. 新实例 Postgres 17，`pg_restore -j 16`，用时 1 小时 12 分钟；\n3. 逻辑复制追平增量，延迟稳定在 200 ms 以内；\n4. 切换：停写 → 等复制追平 → 改连接串 → 恢复写，**停写 3 分 41 秒**；\n5. 校验：每张表行数一致，抽样 10 万行逐列比对无差异。\n\n发现的问题：\n\n- `orders` 上有一个函数索引用了 `to_char`，17 里被标成了不安全，需要改成 immutable 的包装函数；\n- 连接池 pgbouncer 1.21 和 17 的 SCRAM 有兼容问题，升到 1.23 解决。\n\n正式迁移建议放在周六上午，预计停写 4 分钟以内。需要你确认时间，我来发公告。","words":[{"text":"迁移演练的完整记录：\n\n1. `pg_dump --format=directory -j 8` 导出 412 GB，用时 38 分钟；\n2. 新实例 Postgres 17，`pg_restore -j 16`，用时 1 小时 12 分钟；\n3. 逻辑复制追平增量，延迟稳定在 200 ms 以内；\n4. 切换：停写 → 等复制追平 → 改连接串 → 恢复写，**停写 3 分 41 秒**；\n5. 校验：每张表行数一致，抽样 10 万行逐列比对无差异。\n\n发现的问题：\n\n- `orders` 上有一个函数索引用了 `to_char`，17 里被标成了不安全，需要改成 immutable 的包装函数；\n- 连接池 pgbouncer 1.21 和 17 的 SCRAM 有兼容问题，升到 1.23 解决。\n\n正式迁移建议放在周六上午，预计停写 4 分钟以内。需要你确认时间，我来发公告。"}],"attachments":[{"name":"screenshot-299.png","path":".stillfail/uploads/299-screenshot.png","size":248412,"width":1170,"height":2532,"thumbhash":"3OcRJYB4d3h/iIeHeEh3eIhw+j3A","owner":"k-maple-0"}],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791276360000,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"左子健","picture":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-03-10/710200830_8f3c0a2b9d1e4f07c6a5_192.jpg"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"14 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:46:00"}}},{"seq":300,"thread":1001,"ts":"1001.000300","authorKind":"agent","author":"k-maple-0","text":"好的","md":[["p",[[0,2]]]],"attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1791276780000,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Opus 5.5 · xhigh","agent":"k-maple-0","maker":{"id":"anthropic"},"runtime":"claude"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"ago":"7 分钟前","full":"10/6 08:53:00"}},"options":[{"label":"允许这一次"},{"label":"拒绝","detail":"通知 agent 已拒绝"},{"label":"允许一小时","recommended":true}],"card":{"assignee":"me@x.com","assigneeText":"待你决策","type":"options","options":[{"label":"允许这一次"},{"label":"拒绝","detail":"通知 agent 已拒绝"},{"label":"允许一小时","recommended":true}],"vault":"vr-300","vaultAsk":{"name":"GitHub token","reason":"推送 PR #5244 并打开 review","timeoutKind":"idle","timeoutSeconds":3600,"command":"gh pr create --fill","mode":"proxy","hosts":["api.github.com","github.com"],"howText":"代理 · 限 api.github.com, github.com"}},"decision":{"resolved":false},"asked":true}],"elsewhere":[],"more":true,"firstEntry":251,"lastEntry":300,"newer":false,"outbox":[],"link":{"state":"online"},"offline":false,"watch":{"text":"监控中：watch CI #5244","ask":"「watch CI #5244」仍在监控。归档会停止监控。"},"pending":false,"stationUpdate":{"tone":"notice","text":"「Maple」有新版本","detail":"空闲时自动更新","label":"可更新","station":"Maple","from":"0.1.7018","to":"0.1.7020","version":"beta:0.1.7020","open":false,"canUpdate":true},"screens":[{"id":"desktop","kind":"desktop","title":"Maple","line":"桌面 · 3456×2234 ·